{"text": "Suddenly a soft voice called. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nibble, nibble, gnaw. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who is nibbling. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At my little house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The children answered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is only the wind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And kept eating. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the door opened. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a very old woman came out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She gave them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Milk and pancakes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And two soft white beds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the old woman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was really a wicked witch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had red eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And could not see very far. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had built the sweet house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To catch children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the morning she locked Hansel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a small cage. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hansel is too thin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I want to make him fatter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She told Gretel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every day the witch said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hansel, hold out your finger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Hansel held out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A little bone instead.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "s", "o", "f", "t", " ", "v", "o", "i", "c", "e", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "i", "b", "b", "l", "e", ",", " ", "n", "i", "b", "b", "l", "e", ",", " ", "g", "n", "a", "w", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "o", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "i", "b", "b", "l", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "t", " ", "m", "y", " ", "l", 